          <div class="dashboard-intro-side"><p>Track funded covers, observation windows, and finalized settlement from one calm workspace.</p><button class="button button-dark" @click="openCreateFlow">New cover <ArrowRight :size="15" /></button></div>
        </div>

        <div v-if="notice" class="notice" :class="`notice-${notice.kind}`" role="status">
